    "Maximum Facility Amount is presented as a fixed USD 675 million post-pricing, yet the Key Covenants state it is tied to subordinated note issuance at a 9x post-pricing multiplier; with a Subordinated Lender Commitment of USD 187.5 million, the 9x formula would imply USD 1.6875 billion, which conflicts with a fixed USD 675 million unless a separate cap/lesser-of constraint is specified."
